"as a consumer for various online databases and services.\n"
"\n"
"All information retrieved through this tool originates from external third-"
"party providers. The respective data provider is clearly identifiable within "
"the application at all times. By retrieving this data, you acknowledge that "
"the terms of use and licensing policies of the respective provider apply. "
"tinyMediaManager assumes no responsibility for the accuracy, legality, or "
"availability of this external content. Use of these interfaces is at your "
"own risk and subject to the provider's guidelines.\n"
